{"seq":1,"slug":"gev-block-maxima","title":"GEV 与块最大值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/models/gev-block-maxima","wordCount":1514,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"gev-与块最大值\">GEV 与块最大值</h1><p>水文学家手里常有一份长达百年的日流量记录，可他真正要回答的问题只有一个：百年一遇的洪峰是多大？他不会把十万个日观测一股脑塞进模型——绝大多数平静日子对洪峰毫无信息。他会做一件极值理论最古老也最稳健的事：把记录切成一年一块，每块只留当年的最大流量，再用这些年最大值拟合一条广义极值分布。这套&quot;分块取最大、拟合 GEV&quot;的范式，就是块最大值（Block Maxima, BM）方法。本篇把 GEV 的参数含义、块最大值的完整流程、以及它的优劣讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-gev-一个分布装下三类极限\">核心概念：GEV 一个分布装下三类极限</h2><p><a href=\"../foundations/three-extreme-types\">三类极值分布</a>已给出 GEV 的统一形式，这里把它当作建模工具重新审视。GEV 的分布函数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ξ</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(x) = \\exp\\left\\{-\\left[1 + \\xi\\left(\\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right)\\right]^{-1/\\xi}\\right\\}, \\quad 1 + \\xi\\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma} &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个参数各司其职，理解它们的物理意义是正确解读拟合结果的前提：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>位置参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：决定分布中心的横向位置，量纲与数据相同。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，整条分布右移，极值整体偏大。</li>\n<li><strong>尺度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：决定离散程度，类似标准差。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，极值波动越剧烈。</li>\n<li><strong>形状参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：最关键，决定尾部类型与吸引域。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 重尾（Fréchet），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 轻尾（Gumbel，取极限），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 有界（Weibull）。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>估计敏感性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>位置</td>\n<td>分布中心位置</td>\n<td>较稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>尺度</td>\n<td>离散程度</td>\n<td>较稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>形状</td>\n<td>尾部类型与外推走向</td>\n<td>极敏感，方差大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计最不稳定，却对回归水平的外推影响最大——它的微小变化会让&quot;千年一遇&quot;的估计上下翻倍。这也是为什么后续<a href=\"../estimation/evt-uncertainty\">极值不确定性</a>花大力气量化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span> 的不确定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"块最大值方法的完整流程\">块最大值方法的完整流程</h2><p>块最大值方法把原始时间序列转化为一组近似独立的极值观测，再用极大似然或 L-矩拟合 GEV。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始时间序列&lt;br/&gt;如百年日流量] --&gt; B[按区块切分&lt;br/&gt;常取一年一块]&#10;  B --&gt; C[每块取最大值&lt;br/&gt;得到块最大值序列]&#10;  C --&gt; D{检验假设}&#10;  D --&gt;|近似独立同分布| E[拟合 GEV&lt;br/&gt;MLE 或 L-矩]&#10;  D --&gt;|有趋势/季节性| F[改用非平稳 GEV&lt;br/&gt;参数随协变量变化]&#10;  E --&gt; G[估计 mu sigma xi]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[反算回归水平]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始时间序列&lt;br/&gt;如百年日流量] --&gt; B[按区块切分&lt;br/&gt;常取一年一块]\n  B --&gt; C[每块取最大值&lt;br/&gt;得到块最大值序列]\n  C --&gt; D{检验假设}\n  D --&gt;|近似独立同分布| E[拟合 GEV&lt;br/&gt;MLE 或 L-矩]\n  D --&gt;|有趋势/季节性| F[改用非平稳 GEV&lt;br/&gt;参数随协变量变化]\n  E --&gt; G[估计 mu sigma xi]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[反算回归水平]</pre><p>每一步都有讲究。<strong>区块大小</strong>是核心权衡：块越大（如年最大值），<a href=\"../foundations/max-stability\">最大值稳定性</a>所要求的极限近似越准，但块数越少、估计方差越大；块太小则每块内观测不足，GEV 近似失真。水文与气候领域几乎一律取&quot;年最大值&quot;，既消除季节性又保证每块有足够多的底层观测。<strong>独立性检验</strong>也不可少：若块最大值之间仍有自相关（如气候的多年涛动），需引入非平稳模型，让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 随时间或协变量变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"极大似然拟合与-l-矩\">极大似然拟合与 L-矩</h2><p>得到块最大值序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{z_1, \\dots, z_m\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 后，最常用的拟合是极大似然估计（MLE）。GEV 的对数似然为各点密度之和，对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi \\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ξ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ξ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell(\\mu,\\sigma,\\xi) = -m\\log\\sigma - (1+\\tfrac{1}{\\xi})\\sum_{i=1}^m \\log\\left[1+\\xi\\tfrac{z_i-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right] - \\sum_{i=1}^m \\left[1+\\xi\\tfrac{z_i-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right]^{-1/\\xi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8544em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8544em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1323em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3073em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>数值最大化即得参数估计。MLE 的渐近正态性在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi &gt; -0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 时成立，这覆盖了几乎所有实际数据；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi &lt; -0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>（极少见的强有界情形）需谨慎。</p>\n<p>对样本量小的数据，<strong>L-矩法</strong>（基于次序统计量的线性组合）往往比 MLE 更稳健、偏差更小，R 的 <code>lmom</code> 包即提供该方法。截至 2026 年，R 生态里块最大值的主力工具是 <code>ismev</code>（1.43 版，配套 Coles 经典教材）与功能更全的 <code>extRemes</code>（2.2-1 版，2026 年 5 月更新，支持贝叶斯与惩罚似然）；Python 侧 <code>pyextremes</code> 与新出的 <code>nsEVDx</code>（2025 年发布，专攻非平稳）也已成熟。这些工具把上述似然最大化封装为一行调用，但参数含义与诊断仍需人来把关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"块最大值的优劣与适用边界\">块最大值的优劣与适用边界</h2><p>块最大值方法的最大优点是概念清晰、对数据依赖结构稳健——分块本身就稀释了块内的自相关。它的致命缺点是<strong>浪费数据</strong>：一年里若有三场特大洪水，块最大值只记录最大那场，另外两场尽管也是极端事件却被整块丢弃。当数据珍贵（如仅几十年记录）时，这种浪费可能让估计方差大到无法接受。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>块最大值 (BM)</th>\n<th>超阈值 (POT)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据利用</td>\n<td>每块仅一个，浪费</td>\n<td>所有超阈值观测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布</td>\n<td>GEV</td>\n<td>广义帕累托 GPD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键决策</td>\n<td>区块大小</td>\n<td>阈值高低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖稳健性</td>\n<td>高（分块稀释自相关）</td>\n<td>需处理聚簇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>年最大值、长记录</td>\n<td>短记录、需充分用数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正因为这种数据浪费，现代实践更偏爱<a href=\"pot-gpd\">POT 与广义帕累托</a>路线——它收集所有超过高阈值的观测，把一年三场洪水都用上。两条路线在数学上同源（都源于 GEV 的尾部），选哪条取决于数据量与领域惯例。但块最大值因其稳健与直观，至今仍是教学起点与许多工程规范的默认方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GEV 用三个参数（位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>、尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>、形状 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span>）统一三类极值极限，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span> 最关键也最难估。</li>\n<li>块最大值方法把序列分块、每块取最大、再拟合 GEV，区块大小是偏差-方差权衡的核心，水文气候常取年最大值。</li>\n<li>拟合主用 MLE（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi&gt;-0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 时渐近性良好），小样本可用更稳健的 L-矩；2026 年主力工具为 <code>ismev</code>、<code>extRemes</code>、<code>pyextremes</code>。</li>\n<li>块最大值的优点是稳健直观，缺点是每块只留一个观测、严重浪费数据。</li>\n<li>数据珍贵时，应转向利用率更高的 POT/GPD 路线，二者数学同源。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>互补的建模路线：<a href=\"pot-gpd\">POT 与广义帕累托</a>；理论根基：<a href=\"../foundations/max-stability\">最大值稳定性</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/three-extreme-types\">三类极值分布</a>。</li>\n<li>拟合后如何换算工程指标：<a href=\"../estimation/return-levels\">回归水平与重现期</a>。</li>\n<li>MLE 的一般原理见<a href=\"../../probability-statistics/statistical-inference/maximum-likelihood\">极大似然估计</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GEV 与块最大值","id":"gev-与块最大值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：GEV 一个分布装下三类极限","id":"核心概念-gev-一个分布装下三类极限"},{"level":2,"text":"块最大值方法的完整流程","id":"块最大值方法的完整流程"},{"level":2,"text":"极大似然拟合与 L-矩","id":"极大似然拟合与-l-矩"},{"level":2,"text":"块最大值的优劣与适用边界","id":"块最大值的优劣与适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"三类极值分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/foundations/three-extreme-types"},"next":{"title":"POT 与广义帕累托","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/models/pot-gpd"}}